# The A-operand row, for stores. Va = (VaHi << 4) | VaLo across two non-contiguous
# fields, so it cannot be an `attach variables` target the way VdRow can; enumerating
# the 64 rows guarded by field equality is the shipped idiom for this (ARM NEON's
# `Dreg: d0 is d0 & regNum=0` does the same thing).
